    <briefdescription>
<para>Calculates the edibility value of prey for a predator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class extends <ref refid="class_edible_decision_probability" kindref="compound">EdibleDecisionProbability</ref> and integrates predation probability information to estimate how valuable a prey is for a predator. It also provides assessment of resource quality for decision-making. </para>
